Attribution to tldr-pages
-------------------------

Most cards are adapted from tldr-pages (https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr),
Copyright (c) the tldr-pages contributors, licensed under CC BY 4.0:
https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/main/LICENSE.md

Each adapted card records its origin in its `source` block:

    source:
      type: tldr
      page: common/<page>.md       # tldr page the example comes from
      commit: <sha>                # pinned tldr-pages commit
      license: CC-BY-4.0
      example: <n>                 # example number in that page

Changes made to the tldr-pages examples: titles and commands were rewritten
or adapted (option forms, placeholder names and defaults), and a description,
tags and a danger level were added to each card. These changes are not
endorsed by the tldr-pages project.

Cards with `source.type: original` were written for GrepMeIfYouCan and are
published under the same CC BY 4.0 license.
